  "summary": "Zoo Design Studio: Recursive KCL parsing is vulnerable to denial-of-service",
  "details": "### Impact\nFeeding a KCL program that wraps an expression in deep, unnecessary parentheses triggers the parser’s recursive `expression` -\u003e `unnecessarily_bracketed` -\u003e `expression` path. With enough nesting, the call stack grows until it exceeds the process stack limit, causing a stack overflow.",
